] except [for] notification. And Allāh knows whatever you reveal and whatever you conceal.","j":7,"h":13,"s":5,"a":99,"sd":null},{"k":"5:100","t":"Say, \"Not equal are the evil and the good, although the abundance of evil might impress you.\" So fear Allāh, O you of understanding, that you may be successful.","j":7,"h":13,"s":5,"a":100,"sd":null},{"k":"5:101","t":"O you who have believed, do not ask about things which, if they are shown to you, will distress you. But if you ask about them while the Qur’ān is being revealed, they will be shown to you. Allāh has pardoned it [i.e., that which is past]; and Allāh is Forgiving and Forbearing.","j":7,"h":13,"s":5,"a":101,"sd":null},{"k":"5:102","t":"A people asked such [questions] before you; then they became thereby disbelievers.","j":7,"h":13,"s":5,"a":102,"sd":null},{"k":"5:103","t":"Allāh has not appointed [such innovations as] baḥīrah or sā’ibah or waṣīlah or ḥām. But those who disbelieve invent falsehood about Allāh, and most of them do not reason.","j":7,"h":13,"s":5,"a":103,"sd":null}],"juz":7,"hizb":13,"surahs":[5],"sajdah":false}